    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>The Main Question</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/cec2253631f74166530629c515dc9ad4.poster.avif?t=1747900627\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/cec2253631f74166530629c515dc9ad4.webm?t=1747900627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do You Belong Here?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just mining for resources \u2014 you\u2019re digging through what\u2019s left of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Frostpoint Toll</i>, the loop is clear: drill, collect, upgrade, repeat.<br>What you saw in the gameplay video is just the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy fast-paced arcade gameplay and mecha power fantasies, you\u2019ll find your place here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>demo</strong> is coming later this year. <strong>Wishlist now</strong>, if you're ready to go deeper.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/4f32bc259ca44388964adab7a6d679c8.avif?t=1747900627\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wake up, Pilot. You\u2019ve arrived at Frostpoint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say hello to your new home, if you can call it that. What\u2019s left of you isn\u2019t much. But it\u2019s enough to operate the drill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Frame is online and ready to harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's dangerous to go alone, and highly inefficient\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your machine is a marvel, capable of leveling cities. You, my friend, have a simpler task: move through rough terrain, dig, smash, and collect for the cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gratitude is expected. After all, you're still here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/b23463762486c37b7439528a3ea7a70a.poster.avif?t=1747900627\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/b23463762486c37b7439528a3ea7a70a.webm?t=1747900627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You have a mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With us, you have nothing but time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay your debt, and forgiveness is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t try to be clever. No sacrifice will save you this time.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/aaa0b63ed536c658262ecca934c63c26.poster.avif?t=1747900627\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/aaa0b63ed536c658262ecca934c63c26.webm?t=1747900627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural maps and destructible terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource-driven progression and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mecha built for war, repurposed for penance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tone that blends humor, melancholy, and cold steel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets buried in the frost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes\u2026 <strong>actual gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may call me <strong>Director</strong>.<br>It was nice to meet you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/4f32bc259ca44388964adab7a6d679c8.avif?t=1747900627\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wake up, Pilot. You\u2019ve arrived at Frostpoint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say hello to your new home, if you can call it that. What\u2019s left of you isn\u2019t much. But it\u2019s enough to operate the drill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Frame is online and ready to harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's dangerous to go alone, and highly inefficient\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your machine is a marvel, capable of leveling cities. You, my friend, have a simpler task: move through rough terrain, dig, smash, and collect for the cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gratitude is expected. After all, you're still here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/b23463762486c37b7439528a3ea7a70a.poster.avif?t=1747900627\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/b23463762486c37b7439528a3ea7a70a.webm?t=1747900627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You have a mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With us, you have nothing but time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay your debt, and forgiveness is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t try to be clever. No sacrifice will save you this time.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/aaa0b63ed536c658262ecca934c63c26.poster.avif?t=1747900627\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507600/extras/aaa0b63ed536c658262ecca934c63c26.webm?t=1747900627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural maps and destructible terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource-driven progression and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mecha built for war, repurposed for penance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tone that blends humor, melancholy, and cold steel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets buried in the frost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes\u2026 <strong>actual gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may call me <strong>Director</strong>.<br>It was nice to meet you.</p>",
    "short_description": "A machine of war, repurposed for labor. Frostpoint Toll is an action roguelike about mining, collecting, and letting go. Because here, moving forward means learning to forgive.",
